{#- Where the page sits, taken from the navigation tree rather than written out
    again here. `nav.trail` is the path the tree already knows; `leaf` is for the
    one thing it cannot know, which is a record. The 796 icons are not
    navigation entries, so an icon page hands its identifier in.

    The element drops the href of the last step itself, so nothing here has to
    decide which one is the page. -#}
{%- set crumbs = leaf is defined and leaf ? nav.trail|merge([{ label: leaf }]) : nav.trail -%}
<sds-nav-breadcrumb items="{{ crumbs|json_encode|e('html_attr') }}"></sds-nav-breadcrumb>
